*> Constants that directives define are used like literals:
*> $SET CONSTANT (Micro Focus) and >>DEFINE (COBOL 2014).
$SET CONSTANT DOGGY "Barky"
>>DEFINE CONSTANT MAX-ITEMS AS 10
>> DEFINE DEBUG-LEVEL AS 2
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DIRECTS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  THE-DOG             PIC X(6) VALUE DOGGY.
01  ITEM-COUNT          PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE MAX-ITEMS TO ITEM-COUNT
    DISPLAY THE-DOG ITEM-COUNT DEBUG-LEVEL
    DISPLAY UNDECLARED-NAME
    STOP RUN.
